; upanaya: the application — substituting the particular into the general.
; fourth limb of panchaavayava.
; "we see: mass=3, velocity=4 → momentum = 3 × 4"
;
; the mantra (udaharana) says mass × velocity → momentum.
; upanaya substitutes the actual values from the question graph.
; this is where the graph walk meets the arithmetic.

(sangati upanaya
  (swarupa pratijnaa)
  (sthita vak-sthalam)
  (kriya sankalana)
  (janya udaharana)
  (phala nigamana))
